sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client as Client (Web/Edge)
    participant CallGW as Call Gateway
    participant CallCtrl as Call Controller
    participant WebRTC as WebRTC Service
    participant STT as STT Service
    participant STTAPI as Whisper/Azure STT API
    participant LLM as LLM Service
    participant TTS as TTS Service
    participant TTSAPI as ElevenLabs/Azure TTS API

    User->>Client: Start call
    Client->>CallGW: POST /calls
    CallGW->>CallCtrl: createCall()
    CallCtrl->>WebRTC: negotiate SDP/ICE
    WebRTC-->>Client: answer media established

    loop streaming audio frames
        Client-->>WebRTC: RTP audio
        WebRTC-->>STT: forward stream
        STT->>STTAPI: transcribe(stream)
        STTAPI-->>STT: partial/Final text
        STT-->>CallCtrl: transcript events
        CallCtrl->>LLM: generate(reply context)
        LLM-->>CallCtrl: text reply
        CallCtrl->>TTS: synthesize(reply)
        TTS->>TTSAPI: TTS request
        TTSAPI-->>TTS: PCM/Opus audio
        TTS-->>WebRTC: audio track
        WebRTC-->>Client: RTP synthesized speech
    end
